# Versioned local config

Config files are JSON objects in version 1 or 2. Both versions require a string workspace and may contain additional JSON-compatible properties that this editor does not own. enabled may be omitted or must be a boolean; when omitted, readEnabled reports false. parseConfig returns the validated document with unknown properties preserved. setEnabled accepts source JSON and a boolean, changes only enabled, and returns serialized JSON retaining the original version and every other property. Invalid JSON, a non-object value, an unsupported version or an incorrectly typed known field is rejected.
